ed-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"本册形式语言接口；原书第1章pp.5–10，PDF16–21的记号对应，不声称逐字定义"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为集合大小的一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d91538d9e6829fd1\" href=\"?note=d91538d9e6829fd1\" title=\"67-df-prim-theory\">67-df-prim-theory</a>。</li>\n<li>固定完整的经典一阶有限证明演算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\">\\(A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\)</span> 对任意公理集合 A 表示存在有限正式推导；演算关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a>，此处不要求 A 有效公理化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_L\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closed}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Closed}_L\\)</span> 是本条引入的闭包算子及封闭性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\}\\qquad(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Closed}_L(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)=T.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\}\\qquad(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Closed}_L(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)=T.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.6 的 Th(T) 对公理集取定理集合，本册写作 Cn_L(T)。这是任意公理集合上的有限句法后承；证明码的有效检查仅在另选有效呈示时使用。原条目直接引用第92册固定 G 语言的语义闭包并改写下标为 L，未记录语言/演算实例化；现给出本地明确闭包，避免依赖签名漂移。经典一阶完备性另外可把此闭包识别为语义后承集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"9a1432082607876a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为集合大小的一阶签名，$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[67-df-sentence]]，$\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)$ 见 [[67-df-prim-theory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为集合大小的一阶签名，$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[67-df-sentence]]，$\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)$ 见 [[67-df-prim-theory]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"9a1432082607876a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定完整的经典一阶有限证明演算 $\\mathrm{PL}$，$A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi$ 对任意公理集合 A 表示存在有限正式推导；演算关系取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]，此处不要求 A 有效公理化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PL}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closed}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi\\}\\qquad(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Closed}_L(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(T)=T.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2383,"backlinks":[{"id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 在同一有效语言中；$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]，$\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-decidable]]。"},{"id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是有效一阶语言，固定有效 Gödel 编号 $g$，$T,U,X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]，$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，有限可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。"},{"id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Deductive closure is the separate property defined in [[67-df-theory-closed]]."},{"id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cn}_L(A)$ 为固定一阶演算的定理集合，见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。"},{"id":"45559b2e50b02071","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 是一元原始递归关系类，见 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-theory-closed]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-theory-closed]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","d91538d9e6829fd1","9a1432082607876a"]}